      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T11:56:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The retry loop calls getRandomId() repeatedly, but getRandomId() reseeds RNG on each call using time+pid. In a tight loop this can reduce entropy and may repeat values. Please consider seeding once (or using a persistent RNG) so retries are statistically independent.",
      "revId": "3892e24ddece737ed364e959aeed909e99e92aef",
